    <author>Domestique Library</author>
    <name>Sweet Spot 3x15min (70min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 9min 30s from 50% to 75% FTP | Intervals: 3 x (15min @ 90% / 3min @ 55%) | Cooldown: 6min 30s from 65% to 45% FTP</description>
